{"4499620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crown & Spores", "steam_appid": 4499620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Following the ban on the sale of magic potions, the witch Kira was exiled to the depths of the swamps. Using her power, she teleported you to this world with the task of taking over her illegal business. Now it is up to you to raise it from the ruins... and bring the kingdom to its knees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4499620/extras/c2b8ad25c77a33181a44eb0d5d462d1b.avif?t=1785274087\" width=1435 height=613 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Discover a diverse world full of contrasts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Traverse vast swamps shrouded in mist, visit peaceful villages bustling with daily life, and reach the mighty walls of the royal city. Each region offers a unique atmosphere and secrets waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4499620/extras/1f1160f802243ac824456df737b83b22.avif?t=1785274087\" width=1442 height=624 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Take on contracts from across the kingdom.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The locals haven't forgotten the taste of good quality! On the notice boards, you will find requests with their needs, and each contract has specific requirements, which means one thing - you must figure them out and deliver! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4499620/extras/7c8b4105921794b9c4e645adb2c0c004.avif?t=1785274087\" width=1434 height=621 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Brew all sorts of unique potions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use various tools, combine and experiment with ingredients, discover increasingly powerful recipes, and use them to spread your products throughout the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4499620/extras/9639b7f52086d6d2abba667a0157c03e.avif?t=1785274087\" width=1435 height=624 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Harness the magical properties of local plants. </strong><br> <br> Buy seeds from local merchants, plant, and harvest. Cater to your customers' tastes, as each plant has its own original effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4499620/extras/e67bc99ef1d13b187246c5ef36a92c88.avif?t=1785274087\" width=1453 height=612 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play with friends in Crown &amp; Spores.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join forces in a co-op mode for up to 4 players and develop your illegal business together. Share tasks, experiment, and build your empire together.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Following the ban on the sale of magic potions, the witch Kira was exiled to the depths of the swamps. Using her power, she teleported you to this world with the task of taking over her illegal business. Now it is up to you to raise it from the ruins... and bring the kingdom to its knees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4499620/extras/c2b8ad25c77a33181a44eb0d5d462d1b.avif?t=1785274087\" width=1435 height=613 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Discover a diverse world full of contrasts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Traverse vast swamps shrouded in mist, visit peaceful villages bustling with daily life, and reach the mighty walls of the royal city. Each region offers a unique atmosphere and secrets waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4499620/extras/1f1160f802243ac824456df737b83b22.avif?t=1785274087\" width=1442 height=624 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Take on contracts from across the kingdom.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The locals haven't forgotten the taste of good quality! On the notice boards, you will find requests with their needs, and each contract has specific requirements, which means one thing - you must figure them out and deliver! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4499620/extras/7c8b4105921794b9c4e645adb2c0c004.avif?t=1785274087\" width=1434 height=621 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Brew all sorts of unique potions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use various tools, combine and experiment with ingredients, discover increasingly powerful recipes, and use them to spread your products throughout the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4499620/extras/9639b7f52086d6d2abba667a0157c03e.avif?t=1785274087\" width=1435 height=624 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Harness the magical properties of local plants. </strong><br> <br> Buy seeds from local merchants, plant, and harvest. Cater to your customers' tastes, as each plant has its own original effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4499620/extras/e67bc99ef1d13b187246c5ef36a92c88.avif?t=1785274087\" width=1453 height=612 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play with friends in Crown &amp; Spores.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join forces in a co-op mode for up to 4 players and develop your illegal business together. Share tasks, experiment, and build your empire together.</p>", "short_description": "Medieval CO-OP simulator where you grow magical plants, brew potions, create illegal products, trade with customers, and build your own underground empire in a fantasy world.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Polish, German, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4499620/fc330026896212adb842f9d2dd210f100b